{"ref":"BDB, מְצוּדָה²","hw":"מְצוּדָה²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְצוּדָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. fastness, stronghold</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.4\">1 S 22:4</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצֻדָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.9\">2 S 5:9</a>, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצֻדַת</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.7\">7</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצוּדָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:3\" href=\"/Psalms.18.3\">ψ 18:3</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצֻדָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.2\">2 S 22:2</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצוּדוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:3\" href=\"/Psalms.31.3\">ψ 31:3</a>;—<em>fastness</em> of David, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.4\">1 S 22:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 24:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.24.23\">24:23</a> (Gi v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 24:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.24.22\">22</a>) <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.17\">2 S 5:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.14\">23:14</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.16\">1 Ch 11:16</a>; read also <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצֻדַת עֲדֻלָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.1\">1 S 22:1</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.13\">2 S 23:13</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.15\">1 Ch 11:15</a>, for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">מְעָרַת</span> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מְעָרָה²\" href=\"/BDB,_מְעָרָה²\", dir=\"rtl\">מְעָרָה</a> p. 792 b); of Jerus., <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצֻדַת צִיּוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.7\">2 S 5:7</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.5\">1 Ch 11:5</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.9\">2 S 5:9</a>; home of eagle <a data-ref=\"Job 39:28\" href=\"/Job.39.28\">Jb 39:28</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁן־סֶלַע</span>); elsewhere fig. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:3\" href=\"/Psalms.18.3\">ψ 18:3</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.2\">2 S 22:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:4\" href=\"/Psalms.31.4\">ψ 31:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:3\" href=\"/Psalms.71.3\">71:3</a> (all + <span dir=\"rtl\">סַלְעִי</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 91:2\" href=\"/Psalms.91.2\">91:2</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסִי</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:2\" href=\"/Psalms.144.2\">144:2</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">חַסְדִּי</span>, but this dub., Krochm Gr Che <span dir=\"rtl\">חִסְנִי</span>, Dy <span dir=\"rtl\">חִזְקִ</span>, Du <span dir=\"rtl\">סַלְעִי</span>; poss. is <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסִי</span>); also <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית מְצוּדוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:3\" href=\"/Psalms.31.3\">31:3</a>.","next":"BDB, צוד","prev":"BDB, מְצוֹדָה²"}